cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "leaf-vein-workflow: napari tools for measuring vein length and VLA by vein order"
abstract: >-
  A napari plugin for measuring vein length and vein length per area (VLA)
  by vein order from scans of cleared leaves. It covers scale calibration,
  ROI selection, two-step Otsu vein masks, semi-automatic assignment of
  1st-3rd order veins from a base and an apex point, manual correction,
  and export of per-order lengths and VLA with processing metadata.
